1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,010
Mrs. Cooper, we say "Catholics,"
not "rosary rattlers."

2
00:00:05,305 --> 00:00:08,895
(Mrs Cooper:)My goodness, it's a wonder
you people in California can talk at all.

3
00:00:10,518 --> 00:00:12,608
(Penny:)This is like the worst Hollywood
tour ever.

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:14,310
Now, dude, she wanted to see churches.

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,320
(Penny:)Hey, they have wine here, don't they?

6
00:00:18,484 --> 00:00:22,154
(Raj(pointing at a crucifixion statue):)Hey, none of our gods
have abs like that.

7
00:00:23,489 --> 00:00:27,079
(Howard:)Yep, that's the last Jew
who did sit-ups.

8
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:30,040
(Howard:)And look where it got him.

9
00:00:31,414 --> 00:00:34,294
(Mrs Cooper:)Hey, while we're here,
why don't we all do some praying?

10
00:00:34,459 --> 00:00:36,669
Let's put a Iittle church in this church.

11
00:00:36,836 --> 00:00:38,166
(Leonard:)Oh, I'm not sure we should...

12
00:00:38,338 --> 00:00:40,128
(Mrs Cooper:)It's easy. I'll show you how.

13
00:00:40,298 --> 00:00:45,348
(Mrs Cooper:)Lord, Mary Cooper here. Coming to you
from Gomorrah, California.

14
00:00:45,845 --> 00:00:49,435
(Mrs Cooper:)I want to thank you
for the blessing that is my little Shelly.

15
00:00:49,599 --> 00:00:52,849
(Mrs Cooper:)I also want to thank you
for the continued strength...

16
00:00:53,061 --> 00:00:57,021
(Mrs Cooper:)...not to coldcock him with my Bible.

